<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy"
  effective="September 20, 2026"
  description="How Souper Greens collects and uses information from our website, phone lines, and text messaging."
>
  <p>
    Souper Greens is operated by Souper Group LLC ("Souper Greens," "we," "us").
    This policy describes what information we collect through our website, phone
    lines, and text messaging, and how we use it.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Contact information you give us</strong> — such as your name,
      email address, or phone number when you email, call, or text us, or sign
      up for updates on our website.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Messages and call information</strong> — the contents of text
      messages, voicemails, and emails you send us, and transcriptions of calls
      to our business lines, so we can respond and keep a record of the
      conversation.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Basic technical information</strong> — standard web server logs
      (such as IP address and browser type) when you visit this site.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use this information to respond to you, provide and improve our
    services, communicate about your inquiries and our opening, and operate our
    business. We do not sell your personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>Text messaging (SMS)</h2>
  <p>
    If you text Souper Greens, we will text you back — that's the point. By
    sending a text message to a Souper Greens business number, or otherwise
    opting in to receive texts from us, you consent to receive text messages
    related to your inquiry or the program you signed up for. Message frequency
    varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP at any time to opt
    out, or HELP for help. Consent to receive text messages is not a condition
    of any purchase.
  </p>
  <!-- REQUIRED-VERBATIM (TCR privacy requirement) — do not edit or paraphrase: -->
  <p>
    We do not sell or share your SMS opt-in data or personal information with
    third parties for marketing purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data
    and consent will not be shared with any third parties, except for service
    providers acting on our behalf solely to deliver messages.
  </p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We share information only with service providers who help us operate (for
    example, telephone, messaging, email, and web hosting platforms), when
    required by law, or in connection with a business transfer. Service
    providers may use the information only to provide services to us.
  </p>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep messages and contact information for as long as needed for the
    purposes above, then delete or anonymize them.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can opt out of text messages at any time by replying STOP. You can ask
    us to access, correct, or delete your information by
    emailing <a href="mailto:hello@soupergreens.com">hello@soupergreens.com</a>.
    California residents may have additional rights under the CCPA/CPRA; we
    honor verified requests as required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    Our website and messaging programs are not directed to children under 13,
    and we do not knowingly collect their information.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If we update this policy, we will post the new version here with a new
    effective date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Souper Group LLC dba Souper Greens · 301 E. Huntington Drive, Arcadia, CA
    91006 · <a href="mailto:hello@soupergreens.com">hello@soupergreens.com</a>
  </p>
</Legal>
